<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy August 6-20 arrival MTBE.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy August 6-20 arrival MTBE.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to buy 3,500 to 7,000-tonnes of August methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE), a company official said on Friday.</p>
<p>CPC requires the gasoline octane enhancer to be delivered August 6-20 on a cost-and-freight (c+f) basis to Kaohsiung or Keelung .</p>
<p>The tender closes June 23 and is valid for two days.</p>
<p>CPC last purchased by tender, 7,000 tonnes of MTBE for July 6-20 at $270 per tonne c+f from Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC).</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
